libkrun: a 2D virtio GPU (no shared memory window): EDID only, no capsets, rutabaga's 2D component
(fences complete at once), every resource in guest pages; for guests whose driver drives only dumb
framebuffers and a cursor (Windows' viogpudo). It goes on virtio-pci (the PCI context gets the map
sender too), and completes a driver's reset (Windows resets it on a driver restart and at
power-down): its threads end and the next activation starts afresh.

